    "body": "This PR adds a config for dbt's language server, which ships in the dbt v2 binary as `dbt lsp`. dbt-labs/dbt has 14k stars.\n\nFormatting is off in `on_init` until dbt-labs/dbt#16814 is fixed, the same kind of capability override `yamlls` makes.\n\nTested on Neovim 0.12.6 with dbt 2.0.9, against a DuckDB project with a package under `dbt_packages/`. Package files share the project's client, nothing starts outside a project, and `:LspDbtCompile` reuses one preview window across models. My own config has used the same root logic and compile command since 6 October, on a Snowflake project with five packages.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-28T02:24:06Z",
